city-through-time (《一城春秋》 A City Through Time) includes code adapted from lemo-opuscar
(https://github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar), used under the MIT License below:

- engine/lib.js        from core/lib.js (interpolation and easing helpers)
- engine/post.js       from core/three/post.js (post-processing)
- engine/studio.js     from the white-model demo (the showroom, the projection shader)
- engine/overlay.js    from the white-model demo (the 2D layer)
- tools/motioncheck.py from the white-model demo
- render/serve.mjs, page.mjs, still.mjs, events.mjs, video.mjs   from core/render/ (serving, opening the page, stills, events, video)
- render/mux.mjs       from core/render/mux.sh (the delivered film)
- tools/sheet.py       from core/render/sheet.py
- audio/sampler.py     from core/audio/sampler.py (sampled instruments; its comments are the original's)
- audio/sfx.py         from core/audio/sfx.py (trimmed)
- audio/codescore.py, audio/mix.py   grew from the white-model demo's score and mix

Each of these files says so in its first lines.

